      "headline": "Lula meets Trump at White House in first bilateral summit, agrees tariff working group",
      "summary": "President Lula traveled to Washington on May 7 for a three-hour meeting with President Trump at the White House, covering tariffs, trade, critical minerals, organized crime, and bilateral relations. The two leaders did not hold a joint press conference as planned, sparking initial speculation; Lula subsequently reported the meeting went 'very well' and that both sides agreed to meet within 30 days on tariff resolution. Brazilian billionaire Joesley Batista (JBS) reportedly helped broker the meeting.",
